      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "最早的一杯饮料，在南杨州咖啡馆外，递给了她当时的男友。",
      "text_sha256": "cb35de571fdcbb1a940cbfc2f7f3f3f6a6672df12c90edd6db40f5aca2888996",
      "audio_text_sha256": "cb35de571fdcbb1a940cbfc2f7f3f3f6a6672df12c90edd6db40f5aca2888996",
      "sha256": "6b493216cc674505208a007c36bafdf00314a9d007400df67e485888a69a4ee3",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "2025年12月14日，南杨州咖啡馆外，男友喝下饮料后昏迷。",
      "text_sha256": "62e2c3e8d01f6af7376032f77d8a8d20f03ff27ae7f81094b480e6615c26d7d9",
      "audio_text_sha256": "62e2c3e8d01f6af7376032f77d8a8d20f03ff27ae7f81094b480e6615c26d7d9",
      "sha256": "3e09ad9176ae287081728d3973369698553016042ab496e8cbc0789f8ddf45d0",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "两天后，他醒来，分手后报案。线索浮出水面。",
      "text_sha256": "f3201523417b96d3a5cd2d6f4f7334def9a97ca6128f7e2a0aa9159cc424c950",
      "audio_text_sha256": "f3201523417b96d3a5cd2d6f4f7334def9a97ca6128f7e2a0aa9159cc424c950",
      "sha256": "34ae2bb54fd41a588df3c9f69dd565723395ed21fa6b79e31d2495f1cefdeba8",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "他活了下来。可屏幕上的红光，没有熄灭。",
      "text_sha256": "4fc0a252a57e09fb6a8f37cd32900f91abf556bab2f8183be3458a23ade0e8fb",
      "audio_text_sha256": "4fc0a252a57e09fb6a8f37cd32900f91abf556bab2f8183be3458a23ade0e8fb",
      "sha256": "0f43c8e4b2e84516fcaab8e6c12fe67700a72d1745613a9b04f01753ae9e9325",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "1月28日，水踰洞。认识不久、不是男友的男子，随她走进旅馆。",
      "text_sha256": "501368551f568840f4d3f7b9e5c444620002af6f2b61d0b8d11353a1e897bd04",
      "audio_text_sha256": "501368551f568840f4d3f7b9e5c444620002af6f2b61d0b8d11353a1e897bd04",
      "sha256": "a6f9f01143a64635de74fd86175bb4289937cf0248be671eb40ae9fb960fc121",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "饭后，是她提出去旅馆。门，在两人身后轻轻合上。",
      "text_sha256": "adfd45f5a35cb8cd281172fdb86cf0a1d86f305fb3a19e2f6ab8870938ef32b1",
      "audio_text_sha256": "adfd45f5a35cb8cd281172fdb86cf0a1d86f305fb3a19e2f6ab8870938ef32b1",
      "sha256": "14391b8bfc8fd9941f4be147f0f51e5409ffb2e889a6e3b38a6ae8f048b24097",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "警方认为，她选的不是偶遇地点，而是封闭、私密的空间。",
      "text_sha256": "dfcb95eb35420efc552eaa583380b5d950118c8af012ba7d2c9e8ddc89dfeda8",
      "audio_text_sha256": "dfcb95eb35420efc552eaa583380b5d950118c8af012ba7d2c9e8ddc89dfeda8",
      "sha256": "cd659b7ef0331a71b9d5060ad462de72a7882e970286880a0d20fe40750baaff",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "两小时后，她独自离开。次日，那名男子死亡。",
      "text_sha256": "0b287282fee5cd461fdd572abbfe0db0bd06cd3757db488ed0bf976b6edf490c",
      "audio_text_sha256": "0b287282fee5cd461fdd572abbfe0db0bd06cd3757db488ed0bf976b6edf490c",
      "sha256": "ee436e8bac0041ff2fab266880c8e6b734b3b86853f7b5222800751b5e90b26c",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "2月9日，第二名二十多岁男子，和她进了同区旅馆。",
      "text_sha256": "ee094e92a89daf17ceefcc9e0b4d42af45e31f2a9f43f7ebdfb321f236b04038",
      "audio_text_sha256": "ee094e92a89daf17ceefcc9e0b4d42af45e31f2a9f43f7ebdfb321f236b04038",
      "sha256": "b5ef9ef94fc0dcebb961b981d99fb1791305af8024c54ed8e9b926f21315f7bd",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他也不是男友。警方封锁现场；两人的姓名职业没有公开。",
      "text_sha256": "b1fa138f8dd8e92da2b02bd8e0d89272e1c1bb93a49fb8e425f8c60a0e66d31f",
      "audio_text_sha256": "b1fa138f8dd8e92da2b02bd8e0d89272e1c1bb93a49fb8e425f8c60a0e66d31f",
      "sha256": "b6e9570a9bf52e2d99bf7cf0987cb862d4029c97f3745ae74a927a3027088ba4",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "两次短暂约会里，他们都替她付了饭钱和房费。",
      "text_sha256": "5408b3f1fbc5b1322bec8aeb8f09ae8ea5e7c02487e18503f83a0b883d3ee965",
      "audio_text_sha256": "5408b3f1fbc5b1322bec8aeb8f09ae8ea5e7c02487e18503f83a0b883d3ee965",
      "sha256": "05b74c28cd96c4962d30536118a3c98ebd29396699d36ce03ba6f03b2b35fca6",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "警方认为，她接近这些男人，是为了满足消费。",
      "text_sha256": "94bdca22d1b140e229d2e4697b80608a4b6d7a03c4ecafa45bed33c27fb98ca3",
      "audio_text_sha256": "94bdca22d1b140e229d2e4697b80608a4b6d7a03c4ecafa45bed33c27fb98ca3",
      "sha256": "abe6dfd79007c7b622512099ea21fd219ea97ee12a44656bcabfbe9b5eb57959",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "检方认为，冲突或索取回报出现时，她试图控制对方。",
      "text_sha256": "2aa533a3bb347aaa6dc6ebc9d42b04eeb93e737418e34c0d4656c31240736ccd",
      "audio_text_sha256": "2aa533a3bb347aaa6dc6ebc9d42b04eeb93e737418e34c0d4656c31240736ccd",
      "sha256": "457af112f50d6edbcfdc9b4642ddc87cf8d5e297628c151a8ec426e321961aa4",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "她却说，自己怕身体接触，只想让他们睡过去。",
      "text_sha256": "544c7dabafc982217406f851b16c7c0f7f4404234490db3a7a2e061051e6ff94",
      "audio_text_sha256": "544c7dabafc982217406f851b16c7c0f7f4404234490db3a7a2e061051e6ff94",
      "sha256": "f019f95b7849780c9949ad0b1ca54189fb814baede42f9fa040984a38c1c2243",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "她说没想杀人。可这个解释，开始被证据推开。",
      "text_sha256": "c6b32e6c9eb3955c7bcea59325c7026833589de773a4a28f35e08642f3f61505",
      "audio_text_sha256": "c6b32e6c9eb3955c7bcea59325c7026833589de773a4a28f35e08642f3f61505",
      "sha256": "d1f813e4441cd99925161d294c909915f078264a120dccb3778fc8acae19fa4c",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "记录显示，她事前反复确认：这样做，可能致命。",
      "text_sha256": "37be960a33a84ad3c3cf820ed9af99a3dade978bce2a136d1376bb1fe4168108",
      "audio_text_sha256": "37be960a33a84ad3c3cf820ed9af99a3dade978bce2a136d1376bb1fe4168108",
      "sha256": "fd50f148d71cec918951831b67d2c20485a33f965cd06222a282592ec9b8d1c3",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "男友昏迷之后，她没有停下；同样的风险，越过下一扇门。",
      "text_sha256": "5f214d5598aa9b2cac2debf4a19ee922f853d09e37fffe1d3d2ba5c7563c8f1d",
      "audio_text_sha256": "5f214d5598aa9b2cac2debf4a19ee922f853d09e37fffe1d3d2ba5c7563c8f1d",
      "sha256": "628b871a5550e354d3d3a29212cc110e60fb43d7171ad6df0c834f382e571c8a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "鉴定、轨迹、聊天记录，扣成两起死亡的证据链。",
      "text_sha256": "dd6867f010682dc118642253338b79c4fc7f33f88cd69599a835d1aef1872452",
      "audio_text_sha256": "dd6867f010682dc118642253338b79c4fc7f33f88cd69599a835d1aef1872452",
      "sha256": "e42df01a973ce68365848c9d7ee22d3f5ce785eb8928400216101e9940c32b27",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "一审法院认为，她知道风险，却仍然继续。",
      "text_sha256": "3a04d72ec74edd4535adc2cc9628ae7a7e999847d4d1a24c120b147668a855b6",
      "audio_text_sha256": "3a04d72ec74edd4535adc2cc9628ae7a7e999847d4d1a24c120b147668a855b6",
      "sha256": "e5efcdd122554c6dc2bfcc7a386a4a93a4b712e6ddac33c14558a309541f5998",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "明知可能死亡，仍任由它发生——未必故意。",
      "text_sha256": "28ec062b8b920ac45c28bba107055675509b06ee42897deaff030d2570419c04",
      "audio_text_sha256": "28ec062b8b920ac45c28bba107055675509b06ee42897deaff030d2570419c04",
      "sha256": "734301e44b8540d2cb75ce428854b42fc61dae5f3df6a6c8fbb547863b8365b2",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "法院认定，驱使她的主因不是爱情，而是经济和消费贪欲。",
      "text_sha256": "9c96956a46e4173f827e9b953741160d5a0b7840345fbe7cb4eeb67a2ada3ce2",
      "audio_text_sha256": "9c96956a46e4173f827e9b953741160d5a0b7840345fbe7cb4eeb67a2ada3ce2",
      "sha256": "c235949428e08405f9b12165204566310ebe5f34b4bbcfa228f2389ea83620b2",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "用户选定的低沉克制男声；像电影旁白一样直接进入现场，句间留白，不使用解说式元叙事",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "过度警惕、回避冲突、缺乏共情，也让关系失了衡。",
      "text_sha256": "35735549c00144fb197214ef0693040205bf8580c632d1e2cb229fa35ae8788e",
      "audio_text_sha256": "35735549c00144fb197214ef0693040205bf8580c632d1e2cb229fa35ae8788e",
